{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_04",
  "title": "詩的容貌",
  "storyCode": "NL-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "80f338d2f220f24193c9351fbd0cb57093720138cb660b4b3fdf9d152c74ca9f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 4-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "燭火和......陰影。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "真令人驚奇......你似乎很懂得如何對法術現象進行歸納......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "當房間裡點燃一支蠟燭時，最吸引你目光的是那點燭光，而真正將你包裹的，是周遭所有器物的影子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "令人讚歎的技藝，薇薇安娜......我的光甚至無法......照亮你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "......抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "我想，按禮節來說，我也應該稱呼您的名字，瑪嘉烈小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "這——這真的是我們熟知的騎士競技嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "兩位騎士，似乎不急於爭勝，不急於廝殺，場面甚至可以說——就像貴族優雅的社交！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "但、但就算如此——剛才的法術，燭騎士那一閃而過的劍術，是否吞沒了光芒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "耀騎士那彷彿無窮無盡的光輝，是不是已經顯露出了疲態！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "燭火——沒錯，燭光，燭火，但那微小的火光周圍，觀眾們！那光芒周遭的黑夜，沒有被照亮的黑暗似乎更加吸引我們的視線！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "與其說是在操縱那一簇微光，不如說，燭騎士在操縱光芒之下的陰影！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "不得不說！不得不說！即使是在少之又少的冠軍對決中，這樣的情況也十分少見！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "從容且優雅，卻又無處不展現出超高水準的法術碰撞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "這就是耀騎士瑪嘉烈·臨光！這就是燭騎士薇薇安娜·德羅斯特！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "瑪莉婭？瑪莉婭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "人呢......既不在酒吧那邊，也不在家......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......不對......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "唔......唔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我怎麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......你......？你是那個......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "無胄盟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......不，別這麼緊張。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "只要你安安靜靜待著，我們是不會把你怎麼樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "畢竟，要是把臨光一家最寶貝的小女兒傷著了......耀騎士和瑪恩納是不會袖手旁觀的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "你們......想逼姐姐認輸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "差不多吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......你知道鏽銅那件事嗎？現在感染者們的輿論已經甚囂塵上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "你能想像在這個情況下，耀騎士要是真的拿到了冠軍......會讓事情演變成什麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "只要你姐姐乖乖輸給燭騎士，我們就不用面對那麼多問題，這不是最輕鬆的選擇嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姐姐她......不會認輸的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "你知道嗎，瑪莉婭·臨光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "卡西米爾......就像一座塔，從底層仰望那盤旋向上的樓梯的頂端，永遠，望不見盡頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "老弗！科瓦爾！馬丁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "瑪莉婭好像被——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......你說瑪莉婭，怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "您為什麼不試著自己寫詩呢？看看您多受歡迎，我會為您聯絡出版商，以您的名氣和才華......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "我嗎......？我是......做不到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "您又謙虛了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "不，我這不是什麼謙辭，麥基。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "......瑪嘉烈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "點燃一座雄偉的塔樓，人們能從多遠處看見煙霧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "火焰焚燒不去人們內心的矛盾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "人們會從很遠很遠的地方看見黑煙。但也許那曾是他們的家，他們賴以生存的故鄉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "......那我就更不明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "你這樣的騎士，如果不是抱著改變什麼的心思回到卡西米爾，你的目的又是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "如你所說，薇薇安娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "時代在變化，但這並不代表曾被稱之為美德與正義的東西，也該一併變質。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "我回到這裡，只為了提醒卡西米爾的騎士們，提醒卡西米爾的每一個人——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "——提醒他們，他們早已忘卻的榮耀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "提醒？在現在這個卡西米爾......如何提醒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......你想從我這裡找到答案，但我覺得我未必有這個資格，這不是能靠簡單的對話實現的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "呵呵......您的源石技藝會讀心嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "我只是越發意識到您的正直。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......以及，您問過我，在這幾年的流浪之中，我見識過什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "我見識過，這片大地最深重的慘劇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "見識過感染者們垂危的掙扎，見識過巨大的城市在墜落的天災中土崩瓦解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "......那就是你所見的苦難嗎？你......所悲憫的這片土地？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "我有優秀的夥伴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "不，我想他們已經不只是優秀而已了，他們......閃爍著理想的光輝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "我確實曾迷茫過，薇薇安娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燭騎士",
      "text": "在您那個年紀就奪冠，並遭到流放，誰都會迷茫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "但現在不同了，漫長的旅途盡頭，我找到了同伴與信仰所在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "我不再獨身一人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪嘉烈將長劍插在地面上。\n光芒無聲綻放，騎士的瞳孔裡彷彿流淌著黃金。\n她將是這一切的燈塔與根基。\n她將在此處佇立至死亡，直至遙遠的全部的時間。\n哪怕從未有人從她照亮的道路行過——\n——但現在已不必擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "報告。白金大位......我們已經告知了騎士協會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "但是比賽還在進行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......但願騎士協會動作快一點。不然，她的妹妹可能就要受點苦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......我說過，姐姐不會認輸的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "無妨。等你姐姐看見你的手指被整齊地排列在臨光家的門口......她就不會想要進行下一場比賽了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......反抗的眼神，你還真奇怪。不，你和你姐姐，都很奇怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "就算是聲名遠揚的英雄家族，聯合會在這座大騎士領有多少爪牙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "耀騎士和瑪恩納，“兩個人”，稍微強一點而已，能做什麼？能在大騎士領殺死成百上千的殺手，還不用擔負法律責任？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我記得......你不是一個話多的女性來著，你在緊張嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......算是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "畢竟以前我的工作，只要拉弓、瞄準、鬆手，目標只會在短暫的痛苦過後斷氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "但是最近的命令，又是對孩子出手，又是要和耀騎士扳手腕，唉......真不想工作......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "無胄盟最近，是不是有點下滑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "......報告！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "耀騎士投降了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "不、不是......剛才的定期聯絡，E7，E9沒有回覆......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......那還愣著做什麼，準備好戰鬥啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "全員離開房體，確保A1，A2制高點，不要讓目標有機會逃離。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "三號四號掩護我，對付入侵者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
